        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4814, Zeus Entry Door Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Zeus Front Door Handleset is available in a single cylinder function and a dummy function. The dummy handleset is nonfunctional and often is used as trim on the inactive door of a pair of double doors. The Single cylinder, on the other hand, has a deadbolt that is thrown and retracted by a key from the outside and a thumbturn from the inside. This Zeus Entry Door Handleset is made out of brass and can be finished in several beautiful colors. Choose from a wide array of interior trim knobs and levers--all of which will be finished to match the color you select. Emtek's Modern Zeus Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-zeus-handleset-emtek-s40001\"><b>Stainless Steel Zeus Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Zeus Front Door Handle with Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Zeus Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1\" - 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4804-specifications.pdf?v=1704262352\"><b>Emtek 4814 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4804-finish.jpg?v=1704442284\" width=\"429\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Zeus Front Door Handleset",
                "description": "The Zeus Front Door Handleset is available in a single cylinder function and a dummy function. The dummy handleset is nonfunctional and often is used as trim on the inactive door of a pair of double doors. The Single cylinder, on the other hand, has a deadbolt that is thrown and retracted by a key from the outside and a thumbturn from the inside. This Zeus Entry Door Handleset is made out of brass and can be finished in several beautiful colors. Choose from a wide array of interior trim knobs and levers--all of which will be finished to match the color you select. Emtek's Modern Zeus Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Zeus Entrance Handlesets, Zeus Front Door Handle with Locks, Zeus Front Door Handlesets, Emtek 4814, Emtek 4804, EMT-4814, Zeus Entry Door Handlesets, Zeus Entry Door Handlesets,"
            },
